{
  "description": "The class of every operation type (ADR-094 section 2). Built-in profiles (roles) are derived from the classes: read_only = read, delegate, ask; development = read, write, run, delegate, ask; security = read, run, scan, delegate, ask; review = read, review, run, delegate, ask; merge = read, merge, delegate, ask. Every type of ops/INDEX.json has exactly one class. `tools`: every platform MCP tool with what a profile must allow for it - `read` (a read tool, bounded by the profile's read reach), `operation` (each requested type is checked) or the operation type it stands for (work VM and browser tools). `head_changing`: the types that make or move a commit (separation of duties).",
